#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/about.html:15
msgid "About LM STAIRS"
msgstr "关于 LM STAIRS"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/about.html:17
msgid ""
"Founded in 1985, LM STAIRS has grown into a global leader in the\n"
"            design and fabrication of luxury metal staircases. With "
"headquarters\n"
"            in London and multiple state-of-the-art production facilities, "
"our\n"
"            extensive teams of experienced engineers, designers, and "
"installers\n"
"            have delivered innovative, bespoke solutions for prestigious "
"clients\n"
"            worldwide."
msgstr ""
"LM STAIRS 成立于1985年，已发展成为豪华金属楼梯设计和制造的全球领导者。\n"
"            总部位于伦敦，并拥有多个先进的生产设施，我们经验丰富的工程师、设"
"计师和安装人员团队\n"
"            为全球的知名客户提供了创新的定制解决方案。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/about.html:25
msgid ""
"Our commitment to quality, precision, and innovation is reflected in\n"
"            every project. Using the latest 3D laser measurement technology "
"and\n"
"            advanced CAD systems, we create detailed fabrication drawings "
"and\n"
"            execute projects to the highest standards. We focus our "
"activities\n"
"            on London and its surrounding areas (including Westminster, "
"Camden,\n"
"            Kensington, Islington, and the City of London), but we operate\n"
"            internationally and serve clients around the globe."
msgstr ""
"我们对质量、精确性和创新的承诺体现在每一个项目中。使用最新的3D激光测量技术"
"和\n"
"            先进的CAD系统，我们创建详细的制造图纸，并以最高标准执行项目。\n"
"            我们的活动主要集中在伦敦及其周边地区（包括威斯敏斯特、卡姆登、肯"
"辛顿、\n"
"            伊斯灵顿和伦敦市），但我们在国际上运营，为全球客户服务。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/about.html:34
msgid ""
"At LM STAIRS, we combine traditional craftsmanship with cutting-edge\n"
"            technology, ensuring our clients receive the finest bespoke\n"
"            staircase solutions available."
msgstr ""
"在 LM STAIRS，我们将传统工艺与尖端技术相结合，确保我们的客户获得最优质的定制"
"楼梯解决方案。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/about.html:38
#: steelbusiness/views.py:39
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/contact.html:13
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Contact Us"
msgid "Contact us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/contact.html:16
msgid "For inquiries regarding our products or services, please contact us:"
msgstr "如需咨询我们的产品或服务，请联系我们："

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/contact.html:19
msgid "We can assist you in English, Polish, and Mandarin."
msgstr "我们可以用英语、波兰语和普通话为您提供帮助。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:11 steelbusiness/views.py:34
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:13
msgid ""
"You can find answers to frequently askes questions\n"
"           below."
msgstr "您可以在下面找到常见问题的答案。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:48
msgid "What materials are used in LM STAIRS' metal staircases?"
msgstr "LM STAIRS 的金属楼梯使用哪些材料？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:58
msgid ""
"Our staircases are crafted using high-quality, durable\n"
"                    metals such as stainless steel, aluminum, and custom "
"alloys,\n"
"                    ensuring longevity and a sleek, modern appearance."
msgstr ""
"我们的楼梯采用高质量、耐用的金属制成，如不锈钢、铝和定制合金，\n"
"                    确保其耐用性和时尚现代的外观。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:88
msgid ""
"How long does the fabrication process take for a custom\n"
"                    staircase?"
msgstr "定制楼梯的制造过程需要多长时间？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:99
msgid ""
"Typically, our fabrication process takes between 4 to 6\n"
"                    weeks from final design approval to installation, "
"depending\n"
"                    on the complexity and customization required."
msgstr ""
"通常，从最终设计批准到安装，我们的制造过程需要4到6周，\n"
"                    具体取决于所需的复杂性和定制化程度。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:129
msgid "Which areas do you serve?"
msgstr "您服务哪些地区？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:139
msgid ""
"We primarily focus our activities on London and its\n"
"                    surrounding areas (including Westminster, Camden,\n"
"                    Kensington, Islington, and the City of London), but we "
"also\n"
"                    operate internationally, serving clients around the "
"globe."
msgstr ""
"我们主要专注于伦敦及其周边地区（包括威斯敏斯特、卡姆登、肯辛顿、伊斯灵顿和伦"
"敦市），\n"
"                    但我们也在国际上运营，为全球客户提供服务。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:170
msgid "Do you offer customization options for your staircases?"
msgstr "您是否提供楼梯的定制选项？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:180
msgid ""
"Yes, all of our staircases are bespoke. We work closely with\n"
"                    clients to tailor designs that meet their specific "
"aesthetic\n"
"                    and functional requirements."
msgstr ""
"是的，我们所有的楼梯都是定制的。我们与客户密切合作，\n"
"                    以满足他们特定的美学和功能需求。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:215
msgid "What design software do you use in your staircase projects?"
msgstr "您在楼梯项目中使用什么设计软件？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:225
msgid ""
"We utilize advanced 3D CAD software to create detailed\n"
"                    models and fabrication drawings, ensuring precision and\n"
"                    clarity in every project."
msgstr ""
"我们使用先进的3D CAD软件来创建详细的模型和制作图纸，\n"
"                    确保每个项目的精确性和清晰度。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:255
msgid ""
"Can you provide references or case studies of previous\n"
"                    projects?"
msgstr "您能提供以前项目的参考或案例研究吗？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:266
msgid ""
"Absolutely. We have a comprehensive portfolio of completed\n"
"                    projects and can provide references from satisfied "
"clients\n"
"                    upon request."
msgstr ""
"当然可以。我们有一个完整的已完成项目组合，\n"
"                    并可以根据要求提供满意客户的参考。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:296
msgid ""
"What quality control measures are in place during\n"
"                    production?"
msgstr "在生产过程中有哪些质量控制措施？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:307
msgid ""
"Our production process includes rigorous quality control\n"
"                    checks at every stage, ensuring that every staircase "
"meets\n"
"                    the highest standards of durability and design."
msgstr ""
"我们的生产过程在每个阶段都包括严格的质量控制检查，\n"
"                    确保每个楼梯都符合最高的耐用性和设计标准。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:337
msgid ""
"How do you ensure the safety and durability of your\n"
"                    staircases?"
msgstr "您如何确保楼梯的安全性和耐用性？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:348
msgid ""
"Our designs adhere to international safety standards and\n"
"                    building codes, and we use premium materials along with\n"
"                    advanced fabrication techniques to ensure long-lasting\n"
"                    performance."
msgstr ""
"我们的设计遵循国际安全标准和建筑规范，\n"
"                    我们使用优质材料和先进的制造技术，\n"
"                    以确保持久的性能。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:384
msgid ""
"What is your process for handling design changes during\n"
"                    production?"
msgstr "您在生产过程中如何处理设计变更？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:395
msgid ""
"We maintain open communication with our clients; any\n"
"                    requested changes are thoroughly evaluated and "
"incorporated\n"
"                    into the project with minimal disruption to the timeline."
msgstr ""
"我们与客户保持开放的沟通；任何请求的更改都会被彻底评估，\n"
"                    并在尽量不影响时间表的情况下纳入项目中。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:425
msgid ""
"Are your staircases compliant with local building codes and\n"
"                    regulations?"
msgstr "您的楼梯是否符合当地建筑规范和法规？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:436
msgid ""
"Yes, all of our designs meet or exceed local building codes\n"
"                    and regulations, ensuring both safety and compliance."
msgstr ""
"是的，我们所有的设计都符合或超过当地建筑规范和法规，\n"
"                    确保安全性和合规性。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:465
msgid "How do you manage international orders?"
msgstr "您如何管理国际订单？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:475
msgid ""
"We have a dedicated international sales team that\n"
"                    coordinates logistics, shipping, and installation to "
"provide\n"
"                    a seamless experience for global clients."
msgstr ""
"我们有专门的国际销售团队，负责协调物流、运输和安装，\n"
"                    为全球客户提供无缝的体验。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:505
msgid "What kind of maintenance do your staircases require?"
msgstr "您的楼梯需要什么样的维护？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:515
msgid ""
"Our staircases are designed to be low-maintenance; routine\n"
"                    cleaning and periodic inspections are generally "
"sufficient\n"
"                    to keep them in excellent condition."
msgstr "我们的楼梯设计为低维护；常规清洁和定期检查通常足以保持其良好状态。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:550
msgid ""
"Can you install staircases in both commercial and\n"
"                    residential settings?"
msgstr "您能否在商业和住宅环境中安装楼梯？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:561
msgid ""
"Yes, our solutions are versatile and can be fully customized\n"
"                    for both commercial and residential projects."
msgstr "是的，我们的解决方案多样化，可以完全定制以适应商业和住宅项目。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:590
msgid "Do you provide on-site consultations and measurements?"
msgstr "您是否提供现场咨询和测量服务？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:600
msgid ""
"Yes, our experts are available for on-site consultations and\n"
"                    precise measurements to ensure every project is "
"perfectly\n"
"                    tailored to the space."
msgstr ""
"是的，我们的专家可以进行现场咨询和精确测量，\n"
"                    以确保每个项目都能完美适应空间。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:630
msgid ""
"How do you integrate modern design trends into your\n"
"                    staircases?"
msgstr "您如何将现代设计趋势融入到您的楼梯中？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:641
msgid ""
"We continuously update our design portfolio by incorporating\n"
"                    the latest trends and innovative techniques, ensuring "
"our\n"
"                    staircases remain both timeless and contemporary."
msgstr ""
"我们不断更新我们的设计组合，融入最新的趋势和创新技术，\n"
"                    确保我们的楼梯既经典又现代。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:671
msgid ""
" What types of finishes are available for your metal\n"
"                    staircases?"
msgstr "您的金属楼梯有哪些可用的表面处理类型？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:682
msgid ""
"We offer a wide range of finishes including polished,\n"
"                    brushed, and custom color options to complement any "
"interior\n"
"                    or exterior design."
msgstr ""
"我们提供多种表面处理，包括抛光、拉丝和定制颜色选项，\n"
"                    以配合任何室内或室外设计。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:729
msgid "How do you address noise and vibration in staircase installations?"
msgstr "您如何解决楼梯安装中的噪音和振动问题？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:739
msgid ""
"We employ specialized materials and engineering techniques to minimize noise "
"and vibration, ensuring a quiet and stable installation."
msgstr ""
"我们采用专门的材料和工程技术来最大限度地减少噪音和振动，\n"
"                    确保安静和稳定的安装。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:767
msgid "What is the typical lead time from design to installation?"
msgstr "从设计到安装的典型交付时间是多少？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:777
msgid ""
"Generally, lead times range from 4 to 6 weeks, although highly complex or "
"customized projects may require additional time."
msgstr "通常，交付时间为4到6周，尽管高度复杂或定制的项目可能需要额外的时间。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:805
msgid "Do you offer financing or payment plans for large projects?"
msgstr "您是否为大型项目提供融资或付款计划？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:815
msgid ""
"Yes, we understand the scale of investment required for custom projects and "
"offer flexible financing options to accommodate our clients' needs."
msgstr ""
"是的，我们了解定制项目所需的投资规模，并提供灵活的融资选项以满足客户的需求。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:843
msgid "What certifications or industry standards do your products meet?"
msgstr "您的产品符合哪些认证或行业标准？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:853
msgid ""
"Our products comply with numerous industry standards and certifications, "
"including ISO and local building codes, guaranteeing both quality and safety."
msgstr ""
"我们的产品符合众多行业标准和认证，包括ISO和当地建筑规范，\n"
"                    保证质量和安全。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:886
msgid "What role does technology play in your production process?"
msgstr "技术在您的生产过程中扮演什么角色？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:896
msgid ""
"Technology is at the core of our operations—using 3D laser measurements, "
"advanced CAD modeling, and state-of-the-art fabrication machinery to ensure "
"precision and quality."
msgstr ""
"技术是我们运营的核心——使用3D激光测量、先进的CAD建模和最先进的制造机械，\n"
"                    以确保精确性和质量。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:924
msgid "What is the warranty policy for your metal staircases?"
msgstr "您的金属楼梯的保修政策是什么？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:934
msgid ""
"We offer comprehensive warranties covering both materials and workmanship, "
"providing peace of mind for our clients."
msgstr "我们提供涵盖材料和工艺的全面保修，为客户提供安心保障。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:962
msgid "Can you retrofit or upgrade existing staircase structures?"
msgstr "您能否改造或升级现有的楼梯结构？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:972
msgid ""
"Yes, we provide services to retrofit or upgrade existing staircases, "
"enhancing both functionality and design."
msgstr ""
"是的，我们提供改造或升级现有楼梯的服务，\n"
"                    提升功能性和设计。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1000
msgid ""
"What are the benefits of choosing a bespoke metal staircase over a standard "
"solution?"
msgstr "选择定制金属楼梯而非标准解决方案的好处是什么？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1010
msgid ""
"Bespoke staircases offer tailored design, superior quality, and complete "
"customization to match any interior or exterior environment, making them a "
"unique statement piece."
msgstr ""
"定制楼梯提供量身定制的设计、卓越的质量和完全的定制化，\n"
"                    以匹配任何室内或室外环境，使其成为独特的陈述作品。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1043
msgid "Do you collaborate with architects and interior designers?"
msgstr "您是否与建筑师和室内设计师合作？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1053
msgid ""
"Yes, we work closely with architects, interior designers, and other "
"professionals to develop integrated solutions that enhance any space."
msgstr ""
"是的，我们与建筑师、室内设计师和其他专业人士密切合作，\n"
"                    开发增强任何空间的综合解决方案。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1081
msgid "How is the cost of a custom staircase determined?"
msgstr "定制楼梯的成本是如何确定的？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1091
msgid ""
"Costs depend on design complexity, materials, and the scope of the project. "
"We provide detailed quotations after thorough consultations and measurements."
msgstr ""
"成本取决于设计复杂性、材料和项目范围。\n"
"                    我们在经过详细咨询和测量后提供详细报价。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1119
msgid "What payment methods do you accept?"
msgstr "您接受哪些付款方式？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1129
msgid ""
"We accept various payment methods including bank transfers, credit cards, "
"and secure online payment options."
msgstr "我们接受多种付款方式，包括银行转账、信用卡和安全的在线支付选项。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1157
msgid "Are there any financing options available?"
msgstr "是否有可用的融资选项？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1167
msgid ""
"Yes, we offer flexible financing plans to help our clients manage the "
"investment required for custom staircase projects."
msgstr "是的，我们提供灵活的融资计划，以帮助客户管理定制楼梯项目所需的投资。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1200
msgid "Can you provide 3D visualizations or mock-ups before fabrication?"
msgstr "您能否在生产前提供3D可视化或模型？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1210
msgid ""
"Absolutely. We offer detailed 3D visualizations and mock-ups, allowing "
"clients to review and refine the design before production begins."
msgstr ""
"当然可以。我们提供详细的3D可视化和模型，\n"
"                    让客户在生产开始前审查和完善设计。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1238
msgid "What factors influence the final design of a staircase?"
msgstr "哪些因素会影响楼梯的最终设计？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1248
msgid ""
"Key factors include available space, desired aesthetics, structural "
"requirements, and client specifications. We take all of these into account "
"to create a harmonious design."
msgstr ""
"关键因素包括可用空间、期望的美学效果、结构要求和客户规格。\n"
"                    我们会考虑所有这些因素，以创建和谐的设计。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1276
msgid "How do you ensure the durability of your products in various climates?"
msgstr "您如何确保产品在各种气候条件下的耐用性？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1286
msgid ""
"We select premium, corrosion-resistant materials and employ advanced "
"finishing techniques to ensure our staircases withstand diverse "
"environmental conditions."
msgstr ""
"我们选择优质的耐腐蚀材料，并采用先进的表面处理技术，\n"
"                    以确保我们的楼梯能够承受多种环境条件。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1314
msgid "What sets LM STAIRS apart from other staircase manufacturers?"
msgstr "是什么让LM STAIRS与其他楼梯制造商不同？"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/faq.html:1324
msgid ""
"Our unique blend of traditional craftsmanship and cutting-edge technology, "
"along with bespoke design options and exceptional customer service, "
"distinguishes us as an industry leader."
msgstr ""
"我们将传统工艺与尖端技术独特结合，\n"
"                    加上定制设计选项和卓越的客户服务，\n"
"                    使我们成为行业的领导者。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/home.html:52
#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/services.html:16
msgid "Site Survey and Measurements"
msgstr "现场调查和测量"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/home.html:53
#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/services.html:17
msgid ""
"We conduct thorough on‑site surveys and measurements using the latest "
"measuring devices and 3D lasers."
msgstr "我们使用最新的测量设备和3D激光进行全面的现场调查和测量。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/home.html:53
#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/services.html:17
msgid "We manage every phase from initial assessment to final reporting."
msgstr "我们管理从初步评估到最终报告的每个阶段。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/home.html:61
#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/services.html:25
msgid "Design and Calculations"
msgstr "设计和计算"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/home.html:62
#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/services.html:26
msgid ""
"Our designers use 3D CAD and prepare a complete set of drawings for project "
"approval before production.Every detail is planned comprehensively."
msgstr ""
"我们的设计师使用3D CAD，并在生产前准备完整的图纸集以供项目批准。\n"
"每个细节都经过全面规划。"

#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/home.html:70
#: steelbusiness/templates/steelbusiness/services.html:34
msgid "Fabrication Drawings"
msgstr "制作图纸"

